<title>USA: IBM names principal of consulting group.</title>
<headline>IBM names principal of consulting group.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp said Monday it named Laurence Prusak a managing principal of its IBM Consulting Group.</p>
<p>IBM Consulting Group is part of IBM Global Services unit.</p>
<p>Most recently, Prusak was a principal of Ernst &amp; Young LLP's Center for Business Innovation. He specializes in what is known as &quot;knowledge management,&quot; or efforts to increase a company's competitive advantage.</p>
